# =============================================================================
# Docker build context exclusions.
#
# Without this the context includes node_modules (Studio), bin/obj (six .NET
# projects), the Astro build output and git history — hundreds of MB that are
# never used by an image build and that invalidate the layer cache on every
# unrelated edit. Package *manifests* are deliberately NOT excluded: npm ci and
# dotnet restore both need them.
# =============================================================================

.git
.gitignore
.github
.opencode
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/node_modules
**/bin
**/obj
**/.vite
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.astro
**/.pytest_cache

# Build outputs — the image builds these itself.
src/hercules-studio/dist
src/hercules-web/dist

# Runtime state. HERCULES_DATA_ROOT is pinned inside the container, so a host
# data directory must never leak in and silently seed the test instance.
data
**/data
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Docs and assets not needed to run the agent.
docs
assets
examples
templates
deploy/raspberry-pi

# Not needed at runtime.
**/*.md
!**/README.md
LICENSE
LICENSE-COMMERCIAL.md